ines/designing-for-games#Developer-documentation","line":141},{"title":"Games Pathway","target":"https://developer.apple.com/games/get-started/","line":143},{"title":"Create games for Apple platforms","target":"https://developer.apple.com/games/","line":145},{"title":"Videos","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/designing-for-games#Videos","line":147},{"title":"![","target":"https://devimages-cdn.apple.com/wwdc-services/images/3055294D-836B-4513-B7B0-0BC5666246B0/6C097D36-BE91-4B04-854A-E6264DA86F15/9890_wide_250x141_1x.jpg","line":149},{"title":"![","target":"https://devimages-cdn.apple.com/wwdc-services/images/C03E6E6D-A32A-41D0-9E50-C3C6059820AA/2DB746B8-E0B0-4ED1-B250-902DB7A0F3E7/9196_wide_250x141_1x.jpg","line":151},{"title":"Change log","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/designing-for-games#Change-log","line":153}],"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"key":"ai stuff/antigravity-awesome-skills-main/plugins/antigravity-awesome-skills-claude/skills/hig-platforms/references/designing-for-games.md"},
